! c-just-chord-on-phi.scl
!
! Just-intonation augmented chord (16:20:25, two stacked 5:4 major thirds)
! anchored on the trilogy's phi-tuned C = 266.67 Hz. The chord is pure
! just intonation (5/4 thirds); the anchor frequency is phi-derived.
! The other 9 chromatic notes are at 12-TET. Octave = 2:1, so the scale
! repeats cleanly across registers.
! Set base frequency to 266.67 Hz at MIDI note 60 (C4).
! With that setting:
!   C4  = 266.67 Hz
!   E4  = 333.33 Hz   (5/4 above C, the just major third)
!   G#4 = 416.67 Hz   (25/16 above C, two stacked 5/4 thirds)
!   C5  = 533.33 Hz   (2:1 octave)
!
C just-augmented chord on phi-anchored C (Field Trilogy variant)
 12
